# 🚀 SRE – SLI, SLO, SLA & Error Budget Monitoring

> **A hands-on Site Reliability Engineering project** to understand, measure, and improve application reliability.

## 🎯 What is SRE?

Site Reliability Engineering (SRE) applies software engineering principles to operations to build reliable, scalable, and efficient systems.

## 🧠 Core Concepts – Quick Revision

| Concept | Remember it as |
|---|---|
| 📊 **SLI** | What is the actual service performance? |
| 🎯 **SLO** | What performance target do we want? |
| 🤝 **SLA** | What have we promised our customers? |
| 💰 **Error Budget** | How much failure can we tolerate? |
| 🔥 **Burn Rate** | How fast are we consuming the error budget? |

