| Measurement Window | **Rolling 30 days** |

## 🧮 Important Formulas

**1. Availability**
```text
(Requests with status < 500 / Total Requests) × 100
```

**2. Success Rate**
```text
(HTTP 2xx Requests / Total Requests) × 100
```

**3. Error Rate**
```text
(HTTP 5xx Requests / Total Requests) × 100
```

**4. Error Budget**
```text
1 - SLO Target
```

**5. Error Budget Consumption**
```text
(Actual Bad Events / Allowed Bad Events) × 100
```

**6. Burn Rate**
```text
Observed Error Rate / Allowed Error Rate
```

## 📡 What Will We Monitor?

- Total HTTP requests and requests per second
